WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.881 --> 00:00:15.786
Sign in and the dashboard is the first thing you see.

2
00:00:15.886 --> 00:00:21.528
The top row shows revenue, gross profit, orders, average basket, items sold and refunds.

3
00:00:21.628 --> 00:00:26.836
Each card compares with the period before, so you can see if you are up or down.

4
00:00:26.936 --> 00:00:31.093
Use these buttons to switch between today, 7, 30 and 90 days.

5
00:00:32.594 --> 00:00:36.314
Everything on the page follows the period you choose.

6
00:00:36.415 --> 00:00:41.782
If you have several branches, filter the whole dashboard to one of them, here Camp.

7
00:00:43.083 --> 00:00:46.853
Switch back to all branches to see the whole business.

8
00:00:46.953 --> 00:00:51.134
Sales trend draws this period against the one before it.

9
00:00:51.235 --> 00:00:54.896
Sales by category shows where your money comes from.

10
00:00:54.996 --> 00:00:59.152
Busiest hours tells you when to have more people at the till.

11
00:00:59.252 --> 00:01:04.585
Recent sales lists the latest sales, with a link to the full history.

12
00:01:04.685 --> 00:01:07.716
Top products shows what is selling best.

13
00:01:07.816 --> 00:01:11.861
Inventory health and Low stock warn you before you run out.

14
00:01:11.961 --> 00:01:15.837
Open shifts shows which tills are open right now.

15
00:01:15.937 --> 00:01:22.990
Customer insights, the sales breakdown and the branch comparison round out the picture.

16
00:01:23.090 --> 00:01:26.862
Open Reports from here whenever you want to go deeper.
